  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>the given inequality becomes&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math> or <math><mi>t</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi></mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math> (not possible) or <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi></mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>"
  }
